cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "These files are the exact undershoot engines (E-A, E-B, E-C) of the undershoot companion paper, vendored unmodified from its development code. Its public release (cited below) carries the same three engines, restructured as sumset_undershoot.engines.direct, homogenized and intersection; tests/test_engine_equivalence.py compares the two when the public package is installed. Cite the release."
title: "Code and data for: Undershoot of h-fold sumsets: Apery spectra, similar ordering and the three-distance theorem"
authors:
